44	/// Seconds an agent should wait between claim-status polls (the auth.md claim block `interval`). The
45	/// machine-pollable claim grant that consumes it is a separate ticket; the value is advertised now
46	/// so a polling client can pace itself once that lands.
47	const POLL_INTERVAL_SECS: u64 = 5;
